OL,3,GNEWSAPassengers 'in the dark' over
OL,4,Asuspended Mersey ferry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor has criticised what she
OL,7,Fsaid was an "unacceptable" lack of
OL,8,Finformation about when the Mersey ferry
OL,9,Fservice will return.
OL,11,FThe Snowdrop has been out of action for
OL,12,Fseveral weeks due to what the operator
OL,13,Fsaid iwas a technical issue and the new
OL,14,F#26m Royal Daffodil is yet to start
OL,15,Fpassenger services.
OL,17,FCouncillor Liz Makinson, a member of
OL,18,Fthe Liverpool City Region's transport
OL,19,Fcommittee, said no specific reason had
OL,20,Fbeen issued and "we are as much in the
OL,21,Fdark as everybody else is".
